  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Longevity Heaven has twelve positions split into Eight Extremities and Four Desolations. The Four Desolation Immortals are East Desolation, South Desolation, West Desolation, and North Desolation, four rank eight immortals. The seats are meant only for rank eight Gu Immortals, while the Eight Extremities need at least elite rank seven cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        1238
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "fac_eight_extremities",
        "fac_four_desolations",
        "char_east_desolation_immortal",
        "char_south_desolation_immortal",
        "char_north_desolation_immortal",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Northern Plains’ Longevity Heaven tremors. Flower Lady, who shares the North Desolation Immortal seat with Bull Demon, giggles that West Desolation Immortal Bing Sai Chuan has awakened. A figure walks down a river of rainbow light: tall body, delicate face, sharp icy eyes, and an ugly scar from right ear to the left corner of the lips that flickers with white light and thousand year profound ice coldness. Five Elements Grandmaster recognizes Bing Sai Chuan of Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s generation, a rank eight legend and time path great expert whom Giant Sun tried three times to subdue, now Longevity Heaven’s West Desolation Immortal. Bull Demon and Flower Lady greet him as Senior West Desolation.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bing-sai-chuan-awakens",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_flower_lady",
        "char_bull_demon",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "West Desolation Immortal was born in the same generation as Giant Sun Immortal Venerable. Losing to a venerable is no disgrace; three attempts to subdue him show great strength. His seniority among Longevity Heaven is extremely high. He says he is awake but has little lifespan, asks for current world information, then tells Fang Yuan through Lang Ya land spirit that he is West Desolation Immortal, the current leader of Longevity Heaven, and proposes they forget past conflicts and resist Heavenly Court together. Among the Four Desolation Immortals, East Desolation Immortal holds the highest status, with Bing Sai Chuan only second.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bing-sai-chuan-awakens",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable appointed Bing Sai Chuan as the West Desolation Immortal. At Giant Sun’s request he slumbered for three hundred thousand years, designated as the crucial leader for Longevity Heaven’s grand ambitions.",
      "chapters": [
        1940
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appointment-and-slumber",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
